==Description==
The '''Bewitched Nametag''' is a nametag that could be obtained at Level 14 of the regular [[Hexscape Event#Hexscape Event Battle Pass|Hexscape Event Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it costed {{CandyCorns|410 Candy Corns}} or {{Robux|58}} ({{Robux|43}} for the Black Friday 2024 Sale) to unlock it, with a total cost of {{CandyCorns|2,870 Candy Corns}} or {{Robux|830}} ({{Robux|629}} for the Black Friday 2024 Sale).

The '''Bewitched Nametag''' has yellow-purple gradient text and a black outline. It also emits yellow star particles on a purple and yellow fog.

